1:["$","main",null,{"className":"site-main page-guide","id":"main","children":[["$","script",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"(function(){var m={\"workspace\":\"/guide/screen#workspace\",\"launch\":\"/guide/screen#launch\",\"terminal\":\"/guide/screen#terminal\",\"artifacts\":\"/guide/screen#artifacts\",\"delegate\":\"/guide/agents#delegate\",\"dashboard\":\"/guide/agents#dashboard\",\"notifications\":\"/guide/agents#notifications\",\"save\":\"/guide/agents#save\",\"usage\":\"/guide/settings#usage\",\"logs\":\"/guide/settings#logs\",\"appearance\":\"/guide/settings#appearance\",\"remote\":\"/guide/settings#remote\",\"shortcuts\":\"/guide/settings#shortcuts\",\"glossary\":\"/guide/settings#glossary\"};var h=location.hash.replace(/^#/,'');if(h&&Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(m,h))location.replace(m[h]);})();"}}],["$","header",null,{"className":"page-heading","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"mycmux ガイド"}],["$","h1",null,{"children":"使い方"}],["$","nav",null,{"className":"guide-nav","aria-label":"使い方の中の移動","children":[["$","a",null,{"className":"guide-nav-root","href":"/guide","aria-current":"page","children":"使い方"}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","/guide/screen",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/guide/screen","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"画面と操作"}]}],["$","li","/guide/agents",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/guide/agents","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"エージェントとの作業"}]}],["$","li","/guide/settings",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/guide/settings","aria-current":"$undefined","children":"アカウントと設定"}]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"intro","children":[["$","div","0",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>したいことを選ぶと、その操作へ進めます。使い方は、作業の順に 3 つのページへ分けました。導入の手順は「<a href=\"/start\">はじめる</a>」に、実務の流れは「<a href=\"/recipes\">活用方法</a>」にまとめました。</p><p class=\"link-row\"><a href=\"/guide/settings#shortcuts\" id=\"shortcuts\">よく使うキー</a><a href=\"/guide/settings#glossary\" id=\"glossary\">用語</a></p>"}}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-index","children":[["$","section","screen",{"className":"guide-card","id":"screen","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/guide/screen","children":"画面と操作"}]}],[["$","div","0",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>ワークスペースを分け、エージェントを起動し、端末の出力を読んで成果物を開くまでの基本操作です。</p><p>サイドバーの表示、状態ドット、送った指示の一覧、文書編集のボタンまで説明します。</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/guide/screen#workspace\" id=\"workspace\">作業場所を分けたい</a></li><li><a href=\"/guide/screen#launch\" id=\"launch\">エージェントを起動したい</a></li><li><a href=\"/guide/screen#terminal\" id=\"terminal\">ターミナルの出力をたどりたい</a></li><li><a href=\"/guide/screen#artifacts\" id=\"artifacts\">成果物をプレビューして直したい</a></li></ul>"}}]]]}],["$","section","agents",{"className":"guide-card","id":"agents","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/guide/agents","children":"エージェントとの作業"}]}],[["$","div","0",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>別のエージェントへ任せ、複数の会話をまとめて見て、止まったら気づき、作業を残して戻る操作です。</p><p>起動先の指定、宛先ごとの送信結果、質問カードへの回答、保存記録の戻し方を扱います。</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/guide/agents#delegate\" id=\"delegate\">別のエージェントへ任せたい</a></li><li><a href=\"/guide/agents#dashboard\" id=\"dashboard\">複数の会話をまとめて見たい</a></li><li><a href=\"/guide/agents#notifications\" id=\"notifications\">返事待ちや停止に気づきたい</a></li><li><a href=\"/guide/agents#save\" id=\"save\">作業を残して戻りたい</a></li></ul>"}}]]]}],["$","section","settings",{"className":"guide-card","id":"settings","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/guide/settings","children":"アカウントと設定"}]}],[["$","div","0",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>アカウントと使用量、コストの内訳、見た目とキー、AI と自動化、リモート接続の設定です。よく使うキーと用語は上の近道から開けます。</p><p>12 タブの役割と、自動切り替え、見守り、スマホからの接続手順を確認できます。</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/guide/settings#usage\" id=\"usage\">アカウントと使用量を確かめたい</a></li><li><a href=\"/guide/settings#logs\" id=\"logs\">何にコストがかかったかを見たい</a></li><li><a href=\"/guide/settings#appearance\" id=\"appearance\">見た目やキーを変えたい</a></li><li><a href=\"/guide/settings#automation\" id=\"automation\">AI と自動化を止めたい</a></li><li><a href=\"/guide/settings#remote\" id=\"remote\">リモートやキャラクターを使いたい</a></li></ul><p>操作に関わる最近の変更は、<a href=\"/updates\">最近の変更</a>にまとめています。</p>"}}]]]}]]}]]}]
